# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the root .dockerignore, so this only
# applies to this example's build. The context is the repo root; send only what's copied.
*
!examples/rust-axum/
!packages/components/dist/ssr-wasm/index.wasm
!packages/components/dist/loader-bundle/demo-components/
examples/rust-axum/target
examples/rust-axum/README.md
examples/rust-axum/Dockerfile*
